d 'TVPC': module to implement Time-variant Peter-Clark (TV-PC) causal discovery for time series
d
d   tvpc implements the time-variant Peter-Clark (TV-PC) causal
d discovery algorithm of Aung, Zhu, Lee, Guo and Li (2026,
d Computational Economics, doi:10.1007/s10614-026-11411-x). Each
d series is expanded into time-lagged nodes. Edges between lagged
d nodes, and edges pointing back in time, are forbidden. The PC
d algorithm then prunes the graph with Fisher z
d conditional-independence tests and orients it with v-structures
d and Meek's rules. The skeleton search, the order of the
d conditioning sets and the orientation reproduce the authors'
d gCastle implementation step for step; the estimated graphs are
d identical to gCastle's on the paper's benchmark and on 24
d simulated problems of the paper's size. 
d
d KW:  Peter-Clark elements
d KW: causal discovery
d
d Requires: Stata version 15
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261122
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f tvpc.ado
f tvpc.sthlp
f tvpc_a1.dta
f tvpc_example.do
f tvpc_macro.dta
f tvpc_methods.sthlp
f tvpcgraph.ado
f tvpcgraph.sthlp
f tvpcmci.ado
f tvpcmci.sthlp
f tvpcsens.ado
f tvpcsens.sthlp
f ../_/_tvpc_display.ado
